      "message": "\u003e although libs property will not take any effect when dep_api_srcs is passed.\n\nThis is precisely why I think this should be a separate module type\n\n\u003e the main functionality of the module, which is taking the API file(s) as input, and outputting compiled stub jar file does not change\n\nAgreed. Borrowing a page from OOO principles, the interface remains the same, but the implementations are different between the two \"classes\" (module types).",
