      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just a quick thought but WDYT about the module listed in `dep_api_srcs` providing a `.srcjar` file instead of the `.jar` file? In this way, if a prop is passed, the generated stub java files can just be replaced with the unzipped \u0026 extracted stub java files. This would remove the sed logic and the `libs` property will function as expected as well.",
