      "writtenOn": "2023-03-28T04:17:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this is a better approach than the sed route. A followup question I have: How will we determine the list of files from the srcjar that need to copied? Is it just `ls` on the stubs generated from api file? (We should have a unit/integration test for it)\n\nAnd this also seems a little convoluted to me. The stubs are already available in the srcjar/jar. Why do we need to run metalava again to generate stubs? Is this a temporary solution or do you anticipate this to be the final form?",
