      "message": "The list of files that needs to be copied are 1:1 mapping of the files in srcjar file with same names. \n\nWe need to run metalava to get a list of generated stub files, because there isn\u0027t a 1:1 mapping of classes to stub files (i.e. a single stub java file may contain multiple class definitions). We may get a list of all classes from txt file and extract files that match names (and ignore missing ones), but this seems more unintuitive to me (and it would also need writing commands like `grep`).",
