      "writtenOn": "2023-03-24T02:43:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can this be done by metalava instead using the `--subtract-api` parameter?\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/_/android/platform/tools/metalava/+/1427d031860b451bf41c87586d4c90b4bf6a9fd9:src/test/java/com/android/tools/metalava/OptionsTest.kt;l\u003d143-146;drc\u003d11c913309fb454ab9ef6656be75d6d0d9cf4cb99;bpv\u003d0;bpt\u003d0\n\n```\n$ metalava --subtract-api [api_files...] \u003cfull_api_surface\u003e\n\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1740,
